## Critical Context
- [Preserve all execution-critical details needed for the next action: exact paths, function names, signatures, variables, tokens, IDs, matched sets, page status, calculations, errors, and final submission.]
- [Remove stale exploratory branches only when their removal cannot erase a needed fact or unresolved blocker.]
